# The tests of sem-ch07-flatten-in-for-row. No transcript yet: red at cargo; the checks
# below are from ruling FV: the click moves `$a` in its tick and gives each row's hold
# the row's `$v`; the flatten adopts it after that tick and reads it at the next.
emit Ui.*
use App.*

test each_row_flattens_its_own, @page:
    build
        => expect Ui.Label(text="2: 5")
    click Ui.Button(label="go")
        => expect Ui.Label(text="2: 6")
    compute
        => expect Ui.Label(text="2: 2")
